  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC01-C_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "WizQst161582_00000001",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Khan_EM2_04.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254433,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC35_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "My Lord, you must see reason. The Alphoi, while wise, lack our... resolve, which is why you needed our help. You must leave Bat's trial to us.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Noble_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Vanitus_EM2_04.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1447312,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC01-C_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Very well. So long as Zanadu is rid of Bat forever, I am satisfied. But I would ask the Wizard to accompany you for additional security.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Alphoi_King_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Khan_EM2_05.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254433,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC35_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Yes, you still have the Luminiferous Essence to recover after all. But there isn't room on the Aeroship. Sparck, can you manage the trip?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Noble_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Vanitus_EM2_05.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1447312,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Indeed. We must simply return to Aeriel and launch a Pod to Neumia.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EM2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sparck_EM2_39.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254357,
